WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:10.420
There can not be peace, without first

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.500
a great suffering

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.500
The greater the suffering,

00:00:14.835 --> 00:00:16.355
the greater the peace

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.360
The end you've always feared

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:21.820
is coming

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.680
it's coming

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.020
and the blood will be on your hands

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.780
I prayed to god that it wasn't true

00:00:35.885 --> 00:00:38.065
Soloman Lane escaped in Paris

00:00:39.725 --> 00:00:41.345
And now the world is at risk

00:00:41.655 --> 00:00:43.540
This is the CIA's mission

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:44.745
You use a scalpel,

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.340
I prefer a hammer

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:54.220
This is a bad idea

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.680
Is it ever a good one? honestly

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:00.220
He's not just some observer

00:01:00.945 --> 00:01:02.205
He's an assassin

00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:04.395
 

00:01:05.905 --> 00:01:08.755
You go rogue, he's been authorised to hung you down and kill you

00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:10.035
That's the job,

00:01:12.395 --> 00:01:13.395
no hard feelings

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:17.440
Which way Benji?

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:18.440
Turn left!

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:21.820
what are you waiting for?

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:23.940
I'm jumping out a window

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:25.600
Oh sorry, good luck

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.600
When the clock stops,

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:35.000
Ethan Hunt will loose everyone he ever cared about

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:38.940
You don't understand what you're in involved in

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.440
You need to walk away

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.620
Please don't me go through you

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.040
Ethan that's not who we are

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:51.780
Maybe we need to reconsider that

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:00.360
Accept it Ethan,

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:01.380
you've lost this one

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:02.160
what's done is done

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.240
What's done is done,

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:06.760
when we say it's done

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:08.300
Showtime

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:09.720
Oh my God

